    <section class="block news-section">
      <h2 class="section-heading">主要新闻</h2>
      <div class="news-list"><article class="news-item">
    <a class="news-title" href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/02/palantir-pltr-earnings-q3-2026.html" data-source="CNBC Markets" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Palantir 披露强劲业绩，商业收入首次超过政府收入</a>
    <div class="news-meta">CNBC Markets · 2026-11-02T22:53:20.000Z</div>
    <p class="news-summary">Palantir 公布的业绩显示，其美国商业收入大幅增长，并首次超过政府业务，成为当天最受关注的 AI 应用公司新闻之一，显示企业客户需求仍在扩张。</p>
  </article><article class="news-item">
    <a class="news-title" href="https://www.fool.com/coverage/stock-market-today/2026/11/02/stock-market-today-nov-2-apple-stock-slides-ahead-of-earnings-but-its-latest-results-tell-a-different-story/?.tsrc=rss" data-source="Yahoo Finance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">苹果股价在财报前走弱，市场聚焦假日季指引与利润率</a>
    <div class="news-meta">Yahoo Finance · 2026-11-02T22:45:02.000Z</div>
    <p class="news-summary">苹果股价在财报前下跌，市场关注其最新季度业绩之外，更在意假日季展望、利润率表现以及消费需求韧性。</p>
  </article><article class="news-item">
    <a class="news-title" href="https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/us-equity-indexes-mixed-sell-223541461.html?.tsrc=rss" data-source="Yahoo Finance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">美股盘中表现分化，科技抛压延续，原油同步走弱</a>
    <div class="news-meta">Yahoo Finance · 2026-11-02T22:35:41.000Z</div>
    <p class="news-summary">市场最新综述显示，美股指数涨跌不一，科技股继续承压，同时原油价格回落，投资者在中期选举前重新评估风险偏好。</p>
  </article><article class="news-item">
    <a class="news-title" href="https://finance.yahoo.com/m/4fe38c4f-79dc-38c4-99cf-7844e9e446ee/dow-jones-futures%3A-ai-trade.html?.tsrc=rss" data-source="Yahoo Finance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">美股期指受 AI 交易回落拖累，苹果财报在即</a>
    <div class="news-meta">Yahoo Finance · 2026-11-02T21:53:32.000Z</div>
