  </article><article class="news-item">
    <a class="news-title" href="https://www.fool.com/coverage/stock-market-today/2026/11/02/stock-market-today-nov-2-coreweave-slides-on-debt-concerns-after-crowdstrike-partnership-expands/?.tsrc=rss" data-source="Yahoo Finance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CoreWeave 因债务担忧回落，市场重新审视 AI 融资风险</a>
